{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_st02","storyGroup":"act39side","storySort":14,"storyDependence":"act39side_level_act39side_06_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EP-ST-2","storyName":"倾泻腐朽的花","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"棘刺再次开始修复罗盘，而逃向峡谷的众人不知明日会怎样。镇子中，为雅隆镇操劳一生的西尔弗，被再次复活的安纳斯塔西奥认为生出了不该有的欲望，最终为其所杀。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act39side/level_act39side_st02","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act39side_st02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":12,"next":14,"characters":["温蒂","极境","胡安娜","伊西多","蒂奇","帕斯卡拉","西尔弗","哈维尔","习武教士","安纳斯塔西奥","审判庭教士","小安纳斯塔西奥"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_bg_57_g8_oldcabin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodenship_cabin","volume":"1","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":9},{"type":"text","text":"太阳落了下去，盐漠的晚上冷到所有人都在颤抖。","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"大家翻遍了破落的船舱，才勉强找到了一些不知放了多久的鳞肉干和一口破锅。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"在仿生海龙的帮助下，锅中终于有了一点热气。","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dishes","volume":"1","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_plateplace","volume":"1","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":17},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温蒂","text":"太冷了......之前那些碎木头没撑多久，都已经烧完了，我让小叶先来代替一下火盆吧。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avgnew_400_weedy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温蒂","text":"只是本来它的加热功能是用来暖手的，如果是烹煮食物的话，只能做到这种程度了......","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avgnew_400_weedy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"能吃到热的已经很伟大了！","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"食物和淡水都不多，就算省着吃，这些也只能撑上两三天。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"要是遇到雨云，把集雨用的布袋放出去，估计还能再收回来一点水......但盐漠里的天气向来难以预料。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"外面喷发的那些蒸汽......不能当作水源吗？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"那里面混杂着盐漠深处的微生物，人不能直接喝。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我可以提纯。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你先修复罗盘。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"哈哈，我们先熬过今晚再说吧。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"盐漠深处的夜晚可不是闹着玩的，吃的本来就不够，有人还受了伤，不好好保暖的话，小心睡着睡着人就再也醒不过来了。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"......真的......真的会再也醒不过来了吗？","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"要是现在再遇上盐鳞，我们可能真的就......","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"没事，我可以发挥特长，先给盐鳞传通讯，就说我们来了，让它们准备乖乖受死。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4e/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"......我真不懂，你怎么不管什么时候都能这么没心没肺的？","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3d/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"multiline","name":"温蒂","text":"......忍忍吧，这个时候也就他会贫嘴了......","id":47},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"multiline","name":"温蒂","text":"啊，小心！","id":49},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.3","fadetime":"1","id":50},{"type":"dialog","id":51},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_planeshake","volume":"0.6","id":53},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":54},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":55},{"type":"text","text":"似乎是轧过了一条骸骨，征服宣告号颠簸了起来，破锅与里面的食物一同被震飞。","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"极境一个激灵冲上前去接锅，却被烫得哀嚎。","id":57},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多垫步上前，剑尖精准地穿过锅的把手，这才勉强保住晚餐。","id":58},{"type":"text","text":"一旁，仿生海龙的热气也消散了。","id":59},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"1","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温蒂","text":"加热功能......坏了，等我先修一下......！","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avgnew_400_weedy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"5","times":"50","duration":"0.4","id":64},{"type":"multiline","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"嘶......嘶......好冷......","id":65},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":66},{"type":"multiline","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"阿嚏！","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"我可以炼些简单的发热物质，应该不会花太久......","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"那些材料，用来修罗盘。取暖的事，我来想办法。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"......阿嚏！......阿嚏！","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"......姐姐，能不能再分我一点毯子，我人小，冷得快，真的快要冻死了......","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温蒂","text":"我......","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avgnew_400_weedy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"这种时候就别什么你的我的了，都挤到一块！伊西多，别在那边发愁了，过来吧！","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"multiline","name":"极境","text":"能和我这样的大帅哥挤在一起......","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"12","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":83},{"type":"multiline","name":"极境","text":"唔！毯子盖住我的头了！","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.3","id":88},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":89},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_bg_38_g21_skystarry_L2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":90},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":91},{"type":"text","text":"胡安娜挡在风口，帕斯卡拉被蒂奇裹好，只露出一张被挤成一团的脸。","id":92},{"type":"text","text":"极境和温蒂努力活动着僵硬的手指，好抓起食物送进嘴里。","id":93},{"type":"text","text":"伊西多想要转身回到塑金台，但在拿起探针的那一刻，他意识到，自己冻僵的手指毫无用处。","id":94},{"type":"text","text":"征服宣告号漫无目的地顺风行驶着。","id":95},{"type":"dialog","id":96},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":97},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_bg_57_g8_oldcabin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"呼......我们现在要往哪里去？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"不知道，往深处开吧。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_saferoom_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":104,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4163_rosesa_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"......","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"不知道我们要去哪里......","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"不知道那些臭念经的什么时候追上来......","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"也不知道这么冷，我会不会就醒不过来了，或者是船又撞上什么东西......","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_4163_rosesa_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":110},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-30","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"......","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"......她怎么突然这样了？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"她不该早早抢一个最暖和的位置睡下吗？说不定还会半夜抢我们所有人的毯子。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1580_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"她也就是个十岁刚出头的小丫头。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_1580_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"唉......","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7e/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"她睡着了，还有点发烧，看看她的口袋里有没有什么能用的草药。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"要是明天我就要死在这里了......我还、我还想回我原先的家再睡一觉......","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"大房子还在......我的床、我的被子、我的浴缸......","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"穿最好看的衣服，一套又一套......！","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"吃不完的食物，花不完的钱，我不用再......被人一脚踢出去......","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"被人踢好疼......从街这头滚到街那头，好疼......我只想回一趟家......","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"我要过上好日子......！","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"我不要死在......死在......","id":132},{"type":"dialog","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"......呼......","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕斯卡拉","text":"......","id":136},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"......","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"我没想到这次居然会走到这么危险的地步......抱歉，温蒂，我不该轻易地让你过来......","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温蒂","text":"我既然来了，就是来帮你们的。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avgnew_400_weedy_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"要是能平安回到罗德岛，我把我这个月工资都赔给你！","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_450_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avgnew_400_weedy_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温蒂","text":"不用了，啊哈......我先休息了......","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c4/Avg_avgnew_400_weedy_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"multiline","name":"极境","text":"好......","id":147},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_450_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"multiline","name":"极境","text":"棘刺？你还在干什么？","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"修罗盘，不然我们连骸礁峡谷都开不出去。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"船上颠簸太厉害，我需要搭建足够复杂的法术能量场来稳定心相原质，否则整个罗盘都很可能在我拆解它的那一刻分崩离析。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"即使能够搭建出这样的能量场，我也需要确保自己施术的手足够稳，不会在进行物质重构的过程中出差错......","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"如果在心相原质内部刻印流体源石回路的过程中手有一丝颤抖，都可能废掉整块材料......","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"还有，极境，我也不确定明天我们是否能够......","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"charslot","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"极境","text":"......呼......","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"看他那副样子，应该是累得厉害。今天他一直学着掌舵，之前没做过这种事情吧？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......没有，他之前只负责通讯相关的工作。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你也坐过来些吧，温度还在下降，挤一挤暖和一点。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"小珍珠，你要不......？","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/ca/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"......","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"......夫人......","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"嗯？","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"n","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"......夫人......爸爸说你们出海......海真的是蓝色的吗？","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂奇","text":"爸爸，你们能带我去出海吗？我觉得我长大了......我也能出海了......！","id":176},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"小珍珠？你这是......","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":179},{"type":"charslot","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"那是小时候蒂奇在自己怀里听到的故事。","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"胡安娜把手搭上蒂奇的额头，但现在她的额头已经爬上了皱纹。","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"......","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"伊西多，蒂奇也发烧了，草药还有剩下的吗？","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"multiline","name":"伊西多","text":"我找找......","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_pcket","volume":"1","id":189},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":190},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"multiline","name":"伊西多","text":"是这些。","id":192},{"type":"dialog","id":193},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"翻药声在船舱内响起，伴随着睡梦中的人们沉重的呼吸声。伊西多把锅架在勉强修好的仿生海龙上，准备烧水熬药。","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"胡安娜看着船舱内部光秃秃的骨架，眼神柔和，像是想到很美妙的事。","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"她把草药丢进锅，因为船的颠簸，锅子里发出了小小的，类似海浪的声音。","id":197},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"伊西多，你见过海吗？","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"比天空还要湛蓝的海洋，翻着乳白色泡沫的波浪，仿佛能直接劈向我的云间闪电......","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"伊西多，要不要和我们一起出海？","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1581_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"胡安娜","text":"你会是个很好的船长。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1581_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"......","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"text","text":"在昏暗中，胡安娜的双眼闪闪发光，骨架间，冰凉的星光透进来。","id":209},{"type":"text","text":"他想要开口回答，但嘴张了张，最终还是沉默了下去。","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"在他们逃来的方向，追兵的火光闪烁。","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1577_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊西多","text":"............","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_1577_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"charslot","id":218},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_bg_bg_ibbar.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":220},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":221,"musicid":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"帆布、鳞皮、大量的木材、黄金时代的遗物......","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"但几乎完全没有食物和水。你们确实是走投无路了。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"人总是这样，非要到这种境地，才能明白秩序的可贵。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"......或许吧。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"对秩序的遵从为你们带来了食物、清水与居所。别忘了这一点。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈维尔","text":"......我的人明白谈判是什么意思，他们会遵守定好的条款。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_npc_1579_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"不错，你会成为一个优秀的私掠头领。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"在我的引导下。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1579_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":240},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":241},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"把这些收缴来的物资清点入库，那些强盗也记录他们的姓名，然后带去城镇边缘那几间空置的房子。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"路上小心点，别引起太多镇民的注意。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"是。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"还有他们设计的那艘能在盐漠上行进的船，要完好无损地运回来，那是镇子日后的希望。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"明白了，西尔弗阁下。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"嗯。还有什么要告诉我的吗？","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"我们......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"习武教士","text":"我们事后还是去找了执裁官阁下......但只找到他衣物的残片。我给您放在桌上了。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"知道了。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"后续的事务我会处理。你下去吧，让我独自安静一会儿。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":264},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","volume":"0.7","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":267},{"type":"charslot","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"安纳斯塔西奥，安纳斯塔西奥......","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"我原以为你能拯救我们所有人。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"可你其实只在乎你自己，是吗？","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"charslot","id":275},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":276},{"type":"text","text":"破布上的黑灰沾脏了每天精心擦拭的桌面。西尔弗拎起破布，呆在原地。","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"终于，他还是将那块破布扔进了壁炉，而后擦拭起那张办公桌。","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"一如他每天清晨准时爬上钟塔，凝视着这座历经天灾与人祸，却仍屹立不倒的城镇。","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"你不在乎这个国家，不在乎这座镇子，不在乎这些人。所以你不会明白，安纳斯塔西奥。","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"伊比利亚......不论繁华的商港还是贫瘠的渔村，那些侥幸没被海洋吞没的聚落，没有一座不在混乱中崩溃。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"曾经的雅隆也是如此。是我把半生都投进了这里，是我把它从同类相食的惨剧和惨无人道的暴政中拯救了出来......","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"现在也是我为它取得了能行走大地的盐船，要将它从贫瘠的废土中解放。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"而你，安纳斯塔西奥，你只看得见自己偏执而古板的信仰。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"你永远不属于雅隆，你也永远不会再干涉雅隆。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......我的，雅隆。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_bg_bg_ibbar.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":298},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"1","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......我看看，通过复杂的传动结构，让风力驱动步足行走......","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"原来他们从最开始就没往陆行舰的方向去想。风力步行机......确实是天才般的想法。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"可惜，那个阿戈尔女人，明明有如此才能......","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"只要造上三五艘，再加上从海盗那里缴获的，就能把雅隆的居民都搬上去。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1583_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"几十年了......终于不用再被困在这片养不活任何人的盐漠。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_1583_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":308},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drtywndblw","volume":"0.8","id":310},{"type":"dialog","id":311},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.8","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.6","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.8","block":"true","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"charslot","id":318},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"dialog","id":322},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_57_i06_1","style":"cg","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"1","layer":"1","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"啧，哪里来的怪风。","id":325},{"type":"dialog","id":326},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_57_i06_1","style":"cg","pfrom":"0,0","pto":"0,-70","pduration":"2","afrom":"1","ato":"0","aduration":"1","layer":"1","id":327},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":328},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_match_unignited","volume":"1","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":330},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_57_i06_1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......怎么回事。","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"这屋子漏风的吗，连火也点不着。","id":333},{"type":"dialog","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"几粒微小的火星从火柴头溅起，转瞬间又熄灭。","id":335},{"type":"dialog","id":336},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_match_unignited","volume":"1","id":337},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_match_unignited","volume":"1","channel":"1","delay":"1.2","id":338},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_match_unignited","volume":"1","channel":"2","delay":"2.2","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"3.5","id":340},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_match","volume":"1","channel":"3","id":341},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_57_i06_2","style":"cg","pfrom":"0,-50","pto":"0,0","pduration":"1.5","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"2","layer":"2","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.85","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":348},{"type":"text","text":"他看见纤细的火苗在风中摇曳，忽明忽暗的光在黑暗中晕开。","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"他的眼睛逐渐开始适应，周遭的事物一一在他的视野中浮现。","id":350},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9c/Avg_57_i06_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2.5","id":352},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$plot_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_plot_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":353,"musicid":3},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":354},{"type":"text","text":"然后，他看见一张脸。盐一般苍白的皮肤上，斑驳地挂着赤褐色的血迹，湿漉漉的头发像脏器的残片般无力地垂荡。","id":355},{"type":"text","text":"那是一张死人的脸。","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......你......你......","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"......没有人能在经历过一场那样的爆炸之后活下来......","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"你是怎么做到的？你、你是什么东西？","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"你初次见到我的时候，我也是受了伤，徒步穿越盐漠来到了雅隆。","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"但你那时问我的，是我需不需要帮助。","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"那时的你，多么渴望自己能帮到他人。","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"西尔弗","text":"我......","id":363},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_57_i06_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"可现在呢？当你一次又一次地阻止教士们来救我，当你肆无忌惮地在内心想象我的死亡......你是在谋求什么？","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"你也被欲望所腐化了，是吗？","id":368},{"type":"dialog","id":369},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":372},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_broadswordblood","volume":"1","id":373},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","volume":"1","delay":"0.3","id":374},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_open_drawer","volume":"1","delay":"1","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":376},{"type":"hidecgitem","image":"cgitem_57_i06_2","id":377},{"type":"image","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"没有再说任何一句话，西尔弗瘫倒下去。他似乎想抓住什么，却只是把抽屉拽了出来。","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"花瓣从抽屉中倾泻而下，埋住了西尔弗的半个身子。","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"干枯的花，腐败的花，化作黑灰的花。几年前的花，十几年前的花，几十年前的花。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"长久以来，镇民们为表感谢，向他们的证裁官阁下送上的每一朵花，都在此刻倾泻而下。","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安纳斯塔西奥","text":"......花？","id":383},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":385},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":386},{"type":"charslot","id":387},{"type":"image","id":388},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_bg_bg_ibindoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0.8","fadetime":"0","id":390},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":391},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.3","id":392,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":393},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_broadsword_polish","volume":"0.6","channel":"sw","loop":"false","id":394},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sw","fadetime":"2","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"subtitle","text":"他听到磨刀的声音戛然而止。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":398},{"type":"subtitle","text":"门外人声嘈杂起来，他的母亲尖利地嘶叫着，辩解着，说她磨刀只是为了切菜。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":399},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可家里已经很久没有见过半根菜叶了。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":400},{"type":"subtitle","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"审判庭教士","text":"你安全了，孩子。","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"审判庭教士","text":"你母亲发了疯，但我们已经控制住她了。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":407},{"type":"charslot","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小安纳斯塔西奥","text":"我，我......","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"审判庭教士","text":"天哪，他在吃什么......","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":412},{"type":"charslot","id":413},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小安纳斯塔西奥","text":"不！不要！！","id":415},{"type":"dialog","id":416},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":417},{"type":"subtitle","text":"他像母亲那样尖利地嘶叫着，胡乱挥舞着双手，试图遮掩自己的脸。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":418},{"type":"subtitle","text":"他怕教士闻到肉块的腥味，看到他嘴角沾着的肉屑。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":419},{"type":"subtitle","text":"他明明已经下定了决心，要用死亡终结自己这罪孽的存在，为何此刻，面对这位善良的教士，他又要拼命地掩藏自己的恶行？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":420},{"type":"subtitle","id":421},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":422},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小安纳斯塔西奥","text":"我，我......","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"小安纳斯塔西奥","text":"我有罪......让我死......","id":425},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1587_1#1$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","focus":"m","id":426},{"type":"dialogue","name":"审判庭教士","text":"不，孩子。你只是想活下去，我不该审判你。","id":427,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"审判庭教士","text":"你的罪，该由你自己活着赎清。","id":428,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"审判庭教士","text":"有罪的人千千万万。我们行走大地，就是为了帮那些无力自己赎罪的人，为了祛除他们的罪孽。","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"审判庭教士","text":"你也可以这样做，这样才能赎清你自己的罪。","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"审判庭教士","text":"终有一日，最纯洁的花朵......也会因你的触摸而绽放。","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1587_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":432},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":433},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","keep":"true","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","id":434},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":435},{"type":"charslot","id":436},{"type":"image","id":437}],"characters":["温蒂","极境","胡安娜","伊西多","蒂奇","帕斯卡拉","西尔弗","哈维尔","习武教士","安纳斯塔西奥","审判庭教士","小安纳斯塔西奥"]}